    "window": "outside-window comparisons are rows with marker_in_token_window false: every gender marker lies beyond the model's tokenizer window (512 tokens) for the (query, résumé) pair, so the two forms' token ids are identical and the scores tie. Counts differ by tokenizer (MiniLM uses a different vocabulary). The character-based marker_in_scored_window heuristic is not used.",
